{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_title", "source_sha256": "198b26bede71194eaad8e414588430448ca5f23bc48e6fbb00a82dc238a80200", "ja": "翼とおでかけ1", "zh": "和翼一起外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "541736d33ada594d31b3bcf1e672d25fe51964ae63ddbbddd2e16c2d5b361e73", "ja": "翼とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和翼外出的一个片刻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8a545cecdb884ca6cb51ff2e476432c7ba242f65d6e8c785fc05fbffb3f0aa60", "ja": "（久留米のラジオ局に翼がゲスト出演し、無事に\n収録が終わった。このあとは福岡まで移動だ）", "zh": "（翼作为嘉宾出演了久留米的广播节目，顺利完成了录音。接下来要前往福冈了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "46c3e21f5b35aa7e3bfe328d47e39de016091ae4377e12935d70b0dfdadebf75", "ja": "{$P$}さん、寄り道してもいい\nですか？　わたし、太宰府天満宮に行ってみたくて。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，可以顺路绕个道吗？\n我想去一趟太宰府天满宫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3f5b6706adfba39e9de445dc01da98de87daf29fe11657b0c15932eee95637be", "ja": "太宰府の天満宮といえば、学問の神様だな。", "zh": "说到太宰府天满宫，那就是学问之神了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "291e6d007c3ef4643692362ded51513529458700851e4129adcf16bd97a07d3e", "ja": "そうそう、学問の神様！　すごいご利益があるって、\nさっきラジオのパーソナリティさんに聞いたんです。", "zh": "对对，就是学问之神！听说特别灵验，这些还是我刚才听电台主持人说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9170feeab3803afea21ce3a22f11af305acccc259d0b516eb60ceda86dfc5226", "ja": "そんなにすごいなら、お参りしたら\nわたし、学校のテストで満点取れちゃうかも？", "zh": "要是那么灵验的话，我去参拜一下，说不定就能在学校考试中拿满分了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "149317d69c8ae7c95da2b9a1a1e1d18c1a41007a24d972063181d755aa230d8b", "ja": "そうだな。翼のやる気次第だとは思うけど……\nきっと取れるんじゃないか？", "zh": "是啊，虽然我觉得这还是取决于翼的干劲……\n但肯定能拿到满分吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4dcb6314e04e7b8d2823f1aa14ec20ab416bdc34bdb642251bc03c2ae9e0afc1", "ja": "やったー！　じゃあ、バッチリってことですね！", "zh": "太好了！那就是说，肯定没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "739b61422bc91fda1ba586ef6661ccc3c9f275ef0887e266abef8734cfc5ea1d", "ja": "あ、でも……学問の神様って、\nなんの学問を教えてくれるんですかね～？", "zh": "啊，不过……学问之神，\n到底会教哪门学问呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6820cdb151b9c48950c7a71de8f8ef1097807a6786590427f5cc9e8f646b453e", "ja": "え？　ええと……いや、それも翼次第で\nなんでもありじゃないかな、多分！", "zh": "诶？呃……这个嘛，也得看翼想学什么吧，应该什么都可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu01_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e67260b37ef448211a6aafec2e1566857d6dcde0140caada03ecd6e2e69a1ec5", "ja": "そうなんですね！　えへへ、楽しみ～。一緒に\n勉強しましょうね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "原来是这样！嘿嘿，好期待～。我们一起学习吧，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
